.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "2024" "libmyutils 0.4.1" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "myfilefunctions.h"
int wordCount(FILE *file, int *lines, int *words, int *chars);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wordCount
reads the given file stream from its current position to EOF and stores
the number of lines, words, and characters into the three output
parameters. A word is any maximal sequence of non-whitespace characters.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, -1 on failure.
